                   <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Controls delta used in DeltaDE distance algorithm. Tuning of this parameter can improve quality when there is noise caused by inaccurate distance estimation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                  </property>
